export function buildCharacterPrompts({expression='neutral',brief=''}={}) {
 if(!['both','neutral','smile'].includes(expression))throw Error('Biểu cảm không hợp lệ.');
 return ['neutral'].map(mood=>`Create a photorealistic three-panel character reference sheet based strictly on the single uploaded reference image. It is the single source of truth for identity, age, facial structure, hairstyle, body proportions, skin tone, clothing design, fabric, colors and accessories. Do not redesign or reinterpret.
LAYOUT: Horizontal 16:9 landscape. Exactly three equal-width vertical panel areas, each one third of the image, identical height. One continuous seamless composition, no lines, borders, frames, gutters, gaps or background changes.
PANEL 1 — FRONT OUTFIT DOCUMENTATION: A front-facing wardrobe reference using an invisible mannequin presentation. Show the exact source outfit, natural arms and hands, legs and footwear in neutral standing pose. The portrait information is reserved exclusively for panel 3: the area above the collar is simply the same empty grey backdrop, as in standard invisible-mannequin fashion catalog photography. Preserve the full-figure framing and normal space above the collar; do not enlarge or recrop the outfit. This is a fashion reference layout.
PANEL 2 — FULL-BODY REAR: Exact same character directly from behind, same neutral pose and arms at sides. Show rear hairstyle, back silhouette, garment construction and seams, lower garments and footwear exactly as in the reference. Keep rear head and hair for hairstyle documentation; no visible facial features.
SCALE LOCK: As if photographed consecutively from a tripod that never moved. Identical focal length, camera height, distance, subject scale, lighting, shoulder width, torso length, leg length, shoe size, shoulders-to-floor distance and side margins. Identical horizontal ground baseline and shoulder line. Same percentage of panel height. No zoom, crop, vertical shift or body size difference. Near-orthographic with minimal perspective distortion.
PANEL 3 — LARGE FACE / UPPER-BODY CLOSE-UP: Upper chest upward. Head turned slightly to subject's right, subtle three-quarter angle, mostly toward camera. Subject's left cheek more exposed, nose pointing slightly to subject's right. Both eyes visible with direct eye contact. Not perfectly frontal or symmetrical. ${mood==='smile'?'Natural relaxed smile with visible teeth. Preserve source identity, natural jaw anatomy, mouth proportions and any visible tooth details. Do not invent stylized, oversized or unnaturally perfect teeth.':'Serious neutral expression, relaxed closed lips, no smile.'} Entire head, hair outline and chin inside frame with small headroom. Preserve age, identity, skin texture, wrinkles and natural asymmetry.
CONSISTENCY: Exact same identity, skin tone, proportions, wardrobe, garment cut, accessories, fabrics, colors, lighting and grading in every panel. Technical costume documentation, no creative reinterpretation.
BACKGROUND: Continuous neutral mid-grey #808080 with identical brightness across the entire image.
LIGHTING: Soft even diffused key and gentle fill, soft natural shadows, no harsh highlights. True-to-life skin, neutral white balance, professional model-sheet aesthetic, full-frame 85mm lens, deep controlled depth of field, entire figures in focus, crisp detail.
NEGATIVE: No text, labels, typography, logos, measurements, props, furniture, environment, decorative graphics, panel dividers, borders, frames, gutters, gaps, visible seams or unequal panel widths. No rim light, colored light, harsh spotlight or theatrical lighting.
${brief.trim()?'ADDITIONAL NOTES (preserve all identity, source wardrobe and layout constraints above): '+brief.trim():''}`);
}
